{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日おめでとう(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"358"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/5372070/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで自撮りするときは「人物」モードだったんですか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それとも、他の撮影モードで撮られてたんですか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までずっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「人物」モードの明るさ＋２!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"359"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/5372070/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん、新幹線や飛行機に乗る時は、窓側派？通路側派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちが好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんも通路側に誰もいない窓側派!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"景色を楽しもうと思いつつ、結局寝ちゃうんだこれが。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"360"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/5372070/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログの最後に「ばいばいひめたん」て使って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆーわけで...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいばいひめたそっ(。・ω・。)/\""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"361"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/5372070/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの今日わたし誕生日なので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんに祝ってもらいたいです☆\""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日おめでとうございますー!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何をして1日過ごしたんかな？何か特別なことしたんかなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な1年になりますように(・v・)/!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幸せがいっぱい訪れるってひめたんが予言する!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"362"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/5372070/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『食後はコーヒーと紅茶がございますがどちらが宜しいですか？』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とレストランで言われたらひめたんはどっち？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紅茶派かなー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紅茶だったらミルクと砂糖をいっぱい飲める(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コーヒーだったら牛乳いっぱいいれてコーヒー牛乳みたいになったら飲める(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その前に「オレンジジュースってないですかね...？」って聞いてみる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"363"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/5372070/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんって何の雑誌読んでるのー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分ではあんま買わないんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妹がseventeenとかnon-no読んでるから、たまに借りるー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"364"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/5372070/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな果物とかありますか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"酸っぱい系でなければ何でも好き(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"365"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/5372070/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん、受験はいつ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1月の終わりかなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってもうすぐぢゃ(・o・ノ)ノ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"366"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/5372070/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てかさぁひめたん、随分ひなたんと仲良しなんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂メンバーでいちばん仲良しなのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えーみんなと仲良しよお♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いちばんなんて決めれんー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中３トリオは相変わらず熱いですよ＼(∀)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"367"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/5372070/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんのスクール時代のエピソードも聞きたいな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スクール時代のエピソードを語りだしたら止まらないですよほんとに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このブログでもちょいちょい話題になるからチェックしてみて下さいね★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか機会があったら特集組みたい。うん!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"368"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/5372070/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂のひめたんといえば！！？って言えるトレードマークありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それが、固定の髪型はないし、決めゼリフはないし、なんだろ(・c_・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえずパフォーマンス見てほしいかなー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トークもなかなか好き(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"369"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/5372070/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すずかちゃん、ひめかちゃんと名前がカで終わるのは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"偶然ですか？それとも親がカが好きとかあるんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"姉さんにカをつけたからひめもすずもカがついちゃったらしいですー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"370"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/5372070/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂ってどこが　本拠地なんですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46ってくらいだから乃木坂になるんかなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際乃木坂はいろんな思い出がありますよ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結成オーディション、初めてのイベント、2012年初のイベント。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残念ながら乃木坂に行っても劇場はないのです('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"371"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/5372070/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななせまる（西野七瀬ちゃん）、見た目はおとなしいコかと思ったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"内に秘めていて努力家な女の子だよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イラストもうまいしさぁ。ひめたん、そう思わない？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななせまるかわいーいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えへ←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂始動したての頃からよく一緒にお泊まりしたもんだっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななせまる（西野七瀬chan）がひめたんの似顔絵書いたら、「ω」の口してるのー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それがみんないわく、めっちゃ似てるんだとか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななせまる大好きよーお(*/ω＼*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/5372070/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"372"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/5372070/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョコレート色のブレザー似合ってた(*´ω｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"記者会見の時のエピソードみたいなのがあったら教えて欲しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エピソード。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明治の方が楽屋に来ていただいて一人ずつ挨拶した時のこと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな「学年・名前」言うなかでひめたん一人だけ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「中学３年生の中元日芽香です。ひめたんって呼んで下さい」発言。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽屋が和やかな雰囲気に包まれたとさ。わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"373"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/5372070/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんのバレンタインDayの思い出とかある"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうぢゃねー(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの仲良しさん全員にお菓子配ろうと思ったんよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぢゃけ去年のバレンタインは夜中の３時まで料理やらラッピングやら頑張って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"翌朝の地元のイベントに死にそうになりながら出かけて行った思い出がある(-ω-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもみんなとチョコ交換したら目覚めたよー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/5372070/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}